{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50903","headline":"又一首 · 王贞白","name":"又一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾道岂便丧，时人自不容。\n白头伤久别，青眼忆相逢。\n萍迹风波急，荷衣雾露浓。\n空编太平颂，天子未登封。\n（以上均见《永乐大典》卷一一○○○「六姥」「府」字「明府」条〖十一函一百十册〗。\n以上诸诗，《永乐大典》皆注明出王贞白《灵溪集》。\n《直斋书录解题》卷十九着录此集，共七卷，今不存。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}